{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "81762305-eb4b-8a27-81b1-ea3a97ce5bf6",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:26:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Declan Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:22:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:22:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. I am calling about, um, my property tax. The, the bill for the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:22:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. May I have your name and the address of the property, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:22:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Declan Reardon. R-E-A-R-D-O-N. The house is two twenty-nine Memorial Boulevard. By the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:22:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Reardon. And what can I do for you regarding that account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:22:53-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two things. First, I want to ask... is there an exemption? For, for senior. Or for veteran. I am seventy-something, so maybe I can have something, I do not know the word. A reduction."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:23:10-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the city does offer certain exemptions for qualifying seniors and for veterans. Eligibility depends on the particular program, and an application is required. It is not applied automatically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:23:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And how do I, um, apply? Where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:23:31-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The applications are handled through the Assessor's office here at City Hall. You would fill out a form and provide supporting documentation. For a veteran, that would typically be discharge papers. For a senior, proof of age and sometimes income information."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Discharge papers. I have these. Somewhere in the house. [pause] And the form, I can get it where?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:24:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You may pick one up at the Assessor's counter, or I can have one mailed to you along with your bill. Would you like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:24:13-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, that is good. Mail it. Because I am, uh, I am in the car now. In the line for the school. Waiting for my granddaughter. The engine is running, so if you hear the noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:24:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear it faintly, but you are coming through clearly. Please take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:24:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So the second thing. The bill. I need a duplicate. A copy. I think I put the first one, um, in the wrong place. I cannot find."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can arrange a duplicate bill to be mailed. Is the mailing address the same as the property, two twenty-nine Memorial Boulevard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:25:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Same. Same address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:25:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very good. Let me confirm: a duplicate property tax bill for Declan Reardon, two twenty-nine Memorial Boulevard, and an exemption application included in the envelope."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:25:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Both together. [pause] Sorry, the cars are moving. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not at all. I will wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:25:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I am here. How long, the mail? How many days?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:25:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Typically within several business days, though I cannot give you an exact date. If it has not arrived by the end of next week, please call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:25:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next week. Okay. And the exemption, is there a, a deadline? To apply?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:25:58-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a filing deadline, yes, but I do not have the specific date in front of me. The Assessor's office can tell you precisely. The form itself should also state it. I would recommend you not delay once you receive it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:26:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will do it fast. I find the papers today, maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:26:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be wise. Is there anything else I can assist you with this morning, Mr. Reardon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, that is all. Oh, the girls are coming out. I must go. Thank you, Miss Whitcomb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:26:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You are welcome. Have a good day, and drive carefully."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:26:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
